into campaign, not even halfway point to revisit a week or so later with only New Game as a play option. \r\n2. Game was, clunky and parrying rarely worked when dealing with multiple enemies, about a 3rd of the time. \r\n3. 60$ plus for an alpha release game, biggest mistake I have made on steam. AAA Titles do not exist upon alpha anymore this game make that painfully clear.\r\n4. Make a Time Capsule Dated for next summer and put Space Marine 2 into it, if the devs turn things around  you will hear about it and go, oh right i actually own that game. If you dont hear about it, you will forget it even existed. \r\nYes its that forgettable, and bland. \r\n5. Cry yourself to sleep at night knowing that this is a systemic issue and it will take months or years of serious community Harassment to make this even digestible. \r\n6. Harass the ever living heck out of the devs Sabre interactive, and publicly crucify Focus Entertainment its the only way your going to get enjoyment out of that 60$\r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1729035068, "timestamp_updated": 1729035068, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.380440384149551392", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "177125964", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993465569", "personaname": "Papa Nurgle's Favored Daughter", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KDTaff/", "num_games_owned": 391, "num_reviews": 79, "playtime_forever": 368, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1730179967, "avatar": "6d03d1f2bf95c9481d21f8486622fde7a5ef564a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gimmie some checkerboard pauldron decals for my sadbois the lamenters.\nI would also appreciate some noise marines accessories, cause they're crazy as ♥♥♥♥ and we love em.", "timestamp_created": 1729034988, "timestamp_updated": 1729034988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177125808", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146544251", "personaname": "Cmdr. Briggs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198146544251/", "num_games_owned": 49, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 15256, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5983, "last_played": 1785480070, "avatar": "005e4c29b5e3c5e0315be1e087b907109870c2b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone who dabbled in the 40K universe prior to this game, Space Marine 2 has made me obsessed with the lore of the IP. The gameplay is so simple but so fun and engaging, and every mission still turns out differently from the last. The Emperor's protection is the only thing that allows me to continue mowing down heretics in His name. From my righteous fury with a thunder hammer, to my wrath with a heavy bolter, fighting for the Emperor has never been more fun, engaging, and downright addicting. \n\nThe Emperor Protects.", "timestamp_created": 1729034724, "timestamp_updated": 1729034724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534174501895904541", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177125623", "author": {"steamid": "76561198986321189", "personaname": "yuchong9002", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198986321189/", "num_games_owned": 25, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 688, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 511, "last_played": 1731660584, "avatar": "34adcd2a2c63e40ce323f872f4781ef5ee322413"}, "language": "english", "review": "After campaign play through, I would rate the experience 9/10. Here is a break down of my experience:\nLore: 9/10 Amazing plot even though first time playing warhammer games, unless you don’t like stories. Would love it if they added more campaign\n\nArt:10/10 Fabulous, however, I would love it if they allow camera to move further in some scenes\n\nCombat; 10/10 Smooth and Instant\n", "timestamp_created": 1729034416, "timestamp_updated": 1729034416, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177125617", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089363276", "personaname": "Sanguine Skull", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SanguineSkull/", "num_games_owned": 500, "num_reviews": 86, "playtime_forever": 34111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 159, "playtime_at_review": 3486, "last_played": 1789006604, "avatar": "0f8a104c3f21ba066f0aeacc7895ea48e8d7baf6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've never really been into Warhammer, but this game is doing a really good job of getting me into it. The game is just fun all-around. That's all there is to say.", "timestamp_created": 1729034404, "timestamp_updated": 1729034404, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177125606", "author": {"steamid": "76561198156458999", "personaname": "Bedhead no Quirk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198156458999/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5734, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 888, "last_played": 1753477613, "avatar": "ab80b96def960f9a8cc9eb1296fa9497b09d48f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun game, I played Space Marine 1 and loved it. Campaign was good, weapon variety is good. Story was good. You really feel powerful in this game. Did a great job with the power fantasy. I love 40k. My biggest gripe is the lack of enemy variety. Wish there were more different enemies for the Nids and 1k Sons. I can recommend this game for the single player, but i can't recommend this game for multiplayer, because I am facing a frustrating bug where all my multiplayer progress is not being saved.", "timestamp_created": 1729034392, "timestamp_updated": 1729034392, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177125600", "author": {"steamid": "76561198884361144", "personaname": "Aflack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198884361144/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 29, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 29, "last_played": 1726530550, "avatar": "781c1f3f3f35ca20b315a2924083c363f06b7eab"}, "language": "english", "review": "yeah i bet i would like this game but Easy Anti Cheat consistently crashes the game or my PC due to Norton blocking it (you can't bypass with Norton) and, well, I ain't getting rid of Norton just to play this...", "timestamp_created": 1729034379, "timestamp_updated": 1729034379, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1,