voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124946", "author": {"steamid": "76561198448785513", "personaname": "Skyknighte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198448785513/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4167, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3140, "last_played": 1758667216, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now this is a very good game!", "timestamp_created": 1729033283, "timestamp_updated": 1729033283, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146771937", "personaname": "redsky1335", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198146771937/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4387, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1248, "last_played": 1735245658, "avatar": "51d49ab549cadd06df8c08cf49131fe020aad047"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's nice to finally see a game that is 100% tailored for its target audience (that being WH40k fans and fans of third-person action games) and is totally bereft of political nonsense, or any other modern day issues being stuffed in.\r\n\r\nThis is one of the few western-made games that I can actually immerse myself in and FORGET ABOUT THE REAL WORLD for a little while. That's why many of us turn to gaming, it's an escape, a way to wind down. But in recent years, developers became politically active and decided to push propaganda through their games. The result is garbage.\r\n\r\nTaking the opposite approach leads to a wonderful gaming experience like Space Marine 2. Don't just take my word for it- look at the thousands of reviews. I don't think anyone who plays this game can honestly say \"I don't like this\", outside of the political weirdo crowd I mentioned; they are already complaining about this game's \"toxic masculinity\", which means it did a great job.", "timestamp_created": 1729033242, "timestamp_updated": 1729033242, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124825", "author": {"steamid": "76561199056639375", "personaname": "Darth_revvin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199056639375/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2827, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2827, "last_played": 1752198438, "avatar": "4f7bcfd19d6cfaec1b48a8d5b6512100e46b3059"}, "language": "english", "review": "rare updates and  no new mission types\nevery update you have to pay for skin pack even if you already spent 40 extra bucks to buy the battlepass\non top of that even if you unlock the battlepass with real money eveything is still locked behind in game currency", "timestamp_created": 1729033111, "timestamp_updated": 1752198636, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124674", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045912923", "personaname": "DeltaChrome", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045912923/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1841, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 140, "playtime_at_review": 1171, "last_played": 1788884751, "avatar": "bf513a67c5fbb1c91b8220b560db78837b0e5e70"}, "language": "english", "review": "Solid game. The Devs definitely could have fleshed out the story and character development a bit more, and made the combat less repetitive. That said, I really, really enjoyed it. For someone who's just dipping their toes into 40k lore, this game  was an awesome experience and gave a lot of context to the more abstract things that are discussed in the lore.\n\nFor anyone interested in Warhammer 40K this is a must play.", "timestamp_created": 1729032847, "timestamp_updated": 1729032847, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51530611515045166", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "177124604", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039951001", "personaname": "Ninex", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/quiverkiller/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10311, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 896, "last_played": 1786348717, "avatar": "582c85c4ad5ada63a4c7bc9ab4c71aa10930e1ad"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is amazing", "timestamp_created": 1729032738, "timestamp_updated": 1729032738, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124419", "author": {"steamid": "76561199088609413", "personaname": "SoapyEyeball", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199088609413/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3736, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 663, "last_played": 1764011527, "avatar": "af483ec7994e4c3dc9bfb0736600103149dffba3"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR ULTRAMAR", "timestamp_created": 1729032430, "timestamp_updated": 1729032430, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124403", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068860372", "personaname": "campbell1193", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068860372/", "num_games_owned": 77, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 699, "last_played": 1766895197, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR THE EMPEROR", "timestamp_created": 1729032407, "timestamp_updated": 1729032407, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198949314284", "personaname": "SmolTrappy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198949314284/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 9049, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7679, "last_played": 1749490990, "avatar": "189dfc8f82dd6af4980d031d7592a65bdf4d9e2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "No long winded review here.\r\nBasically, if you liked Space Marine 1, then you'll love Space Marine 2. The beginning was abit rocky when it comes to the servers but they've been hard as work fixing those issues. It's fun and engaging! Enough said! Want to stomp around purging xenos? want to blow stuff up with a rifle that amounts to an RPG in rifle format? want to lug around a gun that turns an RPG in rifle format, into a mounted machine gun that fires bigger rounds? want to use a giant powered crackling warhammer to crush people to death whilst falling from the skies with a jump pack? ..want to rip your foes apart with a chainsaw thats longer than a human whilst being a 10ft tall power armored killing machine?\r\n\r\nThen go have fun! It's honestly quite addictive, the campaign might only be 8 to 9 hours, but the real bread and butter of the game is the Conquest PvE mode, earning points and armory data to rank up your guns to do more dakka! Perk your beloved class out to your liking? go ahead! Maybe you want to dress up your spess mawine to look more or less like your own custom faction? can do!\r\n\r\nAll we need now is for the Developers to start adding in hordes of just chapter emblems and iconography and give us the ability to use chapter markings on BOTH pouldrons.\r\n\r\nAnd whats the most delightful thing? no pay to win, no ingame cash shop, everything you see others wearing, using, you can earn yourself! The game actively rewards you for well.. 'git gud' ..learning to perfectly parry, perfect dodging and having those blissfully cool moments of executing one warrior, only to then suddenly gun strike another in the head, then move on to chainsawing some little guy in half! All the gore you could ask for.\r\n\r\nIf you love Doom, if you love Space Marine 1, heck if you just love games like Elden Ring and that one samurai game with the weird shinobi arm.. well, you'll love this game too!\r\n\r\nHeck, pretty sure this is the first time I'd even support picking up the gold or deluxe edition and/or the season pass. It doesn't lock future playable content behind money, the season pass mostly just includes cosmetics for specific founding chapters and thats it!", "timestamp_created": 1729032334, "timestamp_updated": 1729032334, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124246", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110737453", "personaname": "Fearless Specialist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198110737453/", "num_games_owned": 363, "num_reviews": 84, "playtime_forever": 17781, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5387, "last_played": 1770073627, "avatar": "3636b4798de52fc88d6591ad1f03cbbad7a77ffc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really makes you feel like a Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2.... like, It actually does though.", "timestamp_created": 1729032177, "timestamp_updated": 1729032177, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177124243", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066711018", "personaname": "MopJuice", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MopJuicer/", "num_games_owned": 487, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 1991, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 855, "last_played": 1730082469, "avatar":