 rather disheartening, I hope these issues get fixed.", "timestamp_created": 1729031150, "timestamp_updated": 1729031150, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}]}